  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Every decision made while granting a caller''s wish comes with a cost
    to the natual order (otherwise referred to as <b>Chaos Index</b>). Each wish
    comes with an inherent <b>Chaos Cost</b> as decided by its <b>Parameters</b>.


    Your
    job is not only to figure out what parameters fit each wish but also decide what
    <b>Consequences</b> should befall each caller in order to balance the cost of
    their wish.


    According to the laws of natural order the index ranges from
    <b>-3</b> to <b>+3</b> and should always remain at <b>0</b> to maintain consistent
    and predictable acts of fate.


    For this reason, they advise you keep each
    wish as balanced as possible in order to avoid tipping the scales too far.


    Submitting
    a <b>WishRequest</b> with a <i>defecit</i> of <b>Chaos Cost</b> will result in
    a strike for incorrect balancing. Otherwise, submitting with a <i>surplus</i>
    will warrant a bonus paid in <b>GeneBucks</b>.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61064fa2516a0e944933044735159339, type: 2}
